      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything is just... gone. like, i woke up today and realized nobody is looking for me anymore. no notifications, no emails, nothing. it’s like the version of me that actually mattered just got deleted from the world. i feel like a ghost just walking around in a body that doesn't even belong to me anymore.",
